/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 120 0 R
/E (AI WeatherWise is a RESTful backend platform developed using Node.js and Express.js, with MongoDB and Mongoose for data persistence. The system provides weather information and weather-based insights through secure APIs. It supports JWT-based authentication, password hashing, favorite location management and a fallback mode that keeps the API flow functional when external service access is unavailable.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
